== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to [[wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|''Super Meat Boy'']], one of Edmund McMillen's other games.
* {{Dlc|r}} When picked up, the sound effect that plays is the same one used in [[wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|''Super Meat Boy'']] when the player gets a bandage.
* {{dlc|r}} Super Bandage, along with {{i|1up!}}, {{i|Magic Mushroom}}, {{i|Mini Mush}}, and {{i|Mega Mush}} is one of the few items that make a unique sound upon pickup.

